  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Upgrade your wardrobe with the Rothco Pocket T-Shirt and experience the perfect combination of style and comfort! Made from a comfortable blend of cotton and polyester, this t-shirt features a stylish chest pocket with an embroidered \"R\". The crew neck collar comes with a tagless label, ensuring maximum comfort and preventing chaffing. Whether you&rsquo;re running errands, hitting the gym, or exploring the great outdoors, this versatile tee is the perfect choice.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "133305",
  "description": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Pocket T-shirt provides stylish everyday comfort and convenience with a relaxed fit and sleek chest pocket. The cotton/poly t-shirt features a stylish embroidered Rothco &ldquo;R&rdquo; on the chest pocket. The t-shirt is machine washable for years of reliable wear and comes with a comfortable tagless label. The crew neck t-shirt is perfect for casual wear, athletic training, the great outdoors, and much more.&nbsp;</p>",
